      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ocean_Isle_Beach%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town sits at the southern end of North Carolina’s Atlantic coast, right on the Atlantic Intracoastal Waterway.",
